  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "A plano-convex lens of refractive index <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and focal length <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is kept in contact with another plano-concave lens of refractive index <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and focal length <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> If the radius of curvature of their spherical faces is <math><mi>R</mi></math> each and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math> the <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are related as:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WaDCv",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5cDzc",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hTpgv",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7oM9F",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Lens maker formula for the first lens is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#8734;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>...(</mtext><mn>1</mn><mtext>)</mtext></math></p><p>Lens maker formula for the second&nbsp;lens is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#8734;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>...(</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>)</mtext></math></p><p>After&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mfrac></math>, we get:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
